---

<BaseLayoutEn
  title={`Scientific Council | ${siteEn.shortName}`}
  description="Scientific Council of the S.P. Timoshenko Institute of Mechanics of the NAS of Ukraine."
  activePage="departments"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="panel council-hero-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Structure</p>
        <h1>Scientific Council of the Institute</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          The Scientific Council of the S.P. Timoshenko Institute of Mechanics of the NAS of Ukraine
          is a collegial body that considers key issues of scientific, scientific-organisational,
          educational and research-training activity of the Institute.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="council-summary-grid">
        <article class="council-summary-card">
          <span>{councilMembers.length}</span>
          <p>members of the Scientific Council</p>
        </article>
        <article class="council-summary-card">
          <span>{electedCount}</span>
          <p>elected on 17 November 2026</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Council composition</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Members of the Scientific Council</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="council-grid">
        {councilMembers.map((member, index) => (
          <article class={`council-card ${member.councilRole ? 'has-role' : ''}`}>
            <div class="council-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</div>
            <div class="council-card-body">
              {member.councilRole && <p class="council-role">{member.councilRole}</p>}
              <h2><a class="card-link" href={`${base}/en/people/${member.profileSlug}/`}>{member.name}</a></h2>
              <p>{member.title}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="panel statute-note">
        <h2>Election results — 17 November 2026</h2>
        <p>Pursuant to the Director’s Order No. 22/A of 10 November 2026, a general meeting of the Institute’s researchers was held on 17 November 2026 to elect the Scientific Council for the Director’s term of office. The meeting was chaired by Yevhenii Storozhuk, Corresponding Member of the NAS of Ukraine.</p>
        <p>A total of 94 of the Institute’s 101 researchers (93.1%) participated in the secret ballot, which was conducted at 12 polling stations. All 17 candidates were elected: 15 received 94 votes each, while Viacheslav Bogdanov and Jeremiah Rushchitsky received 93 votes each, with one invalid ballot in each case. No votes were cast against any candidate.</p>
        <p>The general meeting approved the election results by an open vote. The Scientific Council comprises 17 elected and four ex officio members.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayoutEn>
